Falsifies `calendar::verification::each_day_sorts_after_the_one_before_it`.

The defect: `Civil` declares `day` before `month`, so the derived `Ord` compares the day of the month ahead of
the month. The step from 31 January to 1 February, and every other month end, sorts backwards.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(Civil::new(ay, am, ad, 0, 0, 0).unwrap() < Civil::new(by, bm, bd, 0, 0, 0).unwrap())`.

